WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Welcome everyone.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.700
Today, we're going to explore a critical skill

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.320
that can empower each of us to become an everyday hero.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:12.760
We're talking about CPR and the use of an AED for all ages.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:16.600
First, let's consider what it means to be an everyday hero.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.440
It's about being ready to step up

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.480
when someone's life is on the line.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.520
CPR and AED use are vital skills

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.360
that can make a difference in those crucial moments.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.520
Regardless of age or background,

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.719
anyone can learn these life-saving techniques.

00:00:31.719 --> 00:00:33.799
Our goal is to equip you with the knowledge

00:00:33.799 --> 00:00:36.279
and confidence you need to act swiftly

00:00:36.279 --> 00:00:38.759
and effectively in an emergency.

00:00:38.759 --> 00:00:40.880
Let's dive into this journey together

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:42.400
and embrace the opportunity

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.520
to become heroes in our communities.

